@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Reference / reusable template. Illustrative contract/model/pattern, not a product release commitment.
title Template example — Deadline and remaining-budget propagation
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

actor Caller
participant "Entry / total deadline" as E
participant "Owner handler" as H
participant "Adapter" as A
participant "Dependency" as D
Caller -> E : request
E -> H : attributable intent + remaining budget
H -> H : include queue / admission / local processing time
H -> A : remaining budget after elapsed work
A -> D : supported bounded call
D --> A : result or observation loss
A --> H : actual known / partial / unknown outcome
H --> E : truthful response within actual capability
note over E,D
 Do not reset the full deadline at every hop.
 Clock/deadline representation and supported transport need design.
 Client timeout is not remote termination or proof of no effect.
end note

@enduml
